      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:53:27.428771Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "The most common driver pattern for embedded and SoC devices",
      "source_hash": 1607447200269182892,
      "context_hash": 15566527842213307924,
      "translation": "임베디드 및 SoC 디바이스에서 가장 흔히 쓰이는 드라이버 패턴",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "SoC": "SoC",
        "device": "디바이스"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:53:27.428772Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "What platform devices are",
      "source_hash": 13027648056846602015,
      "context_hash": 17215291919286592136,
      "translation": "플랫폼 디바이스란 무엇인가",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "device": "디바이스"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:53:27.428772Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Platform devices are devices that are not discoverable by hardware (unlike PCI or USB).",
      "source_hash": 3020454770320920379,
      "context_hash": 3556412825787350304,
      "translation": "플랫폼 디바이스는 하드웨어로 탐지할 수 없는 디바이스입니다(PCI나 USB와 다릅니다).",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "PCI": "PCI",
        "USB": "USB",
        "device": "디바이스"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:53:27.428773Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "The `platform_device` / `platform_driver` abstraction is part of the Linux driver model that shipped with Linux 2.6.0; a good overview is Jonathan Corbet's 2011 LWN article [(LWN)](https://lwn.net/Articles/448499/).",
      "source_hash": 11391504223772509332,
      "context_hash": 14303669928718701686,
      "translation": "`platform_device` / `platform_driver` 추상화는 Linux 2.6.0과 함께 출시된 Linux 드라이버 모델의 일부이며, 이에 대한 좋은 개요는 Jonathan Corbet의 2011년 LWN 기사 [(LWN)](https://lwn.net/Articles/448499/)입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Jonathan Corbet": "Jonathan Corbet",
        "LWN": "LWN",
        "Linux": "Linux",
        "driver": "드라이버"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:53:27.428773Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:2",
      "source": "Devices are instantiated via:",
      "source_hash": 15568180422406292116,
      "context_hash": 7104339537708466378,
      "translation": "디바이스는 다음을 통해 인스턴스화됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "device": "디바이스"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:53:27.428773Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "**Device tree** (ARM, RISC-V, embedded)",
      "source_hash": 10746061172934198545,
      "context_hash": 14416038342613196276,
      "translation": "**디바이스 트리** (ARM, RISC-V, 임베디드)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "device": "디바이스"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:53:27.428773Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "**ACPI** (x86, modern ARM servers)",
      "source_hash": 5529934125782581033,
      "context_hash": 460277986135210515,
      "translation": "**ACPI** (x86, 최신 ARM 서버)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "ACPI": "ACPI"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:53:27.428773Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "**Board files** (old ARM, legacy)",
      "source_hash": 4983441698295390894,
      "context_hash": 14217978834932897278,
      "translation": "**보드 파일** (구형 ARM, 레거시)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:53:27.428773Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "Examples: UARTs, I2C controllers, GPIO controllers, clocks — hardware that's wired onto the SoC and can't be dynamically probed.",
      "source_hash": 9575460435884087150,
      "context_hash": 6562207081825867697,
      "translation": "예: UART, I2C 컨트롤러, GPIO 컨트롤러, 클럭 — SoC에 배선되어 있어 동적으로 탐지(probe)할 수 없는 하드웨어입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "SoC": "SoC",
        "UART": "UART",
        "controller": "컨트롤러"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:53:27.428773Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "struct platform_driver",
      "source_hash": 9035655313327522215,
      "context_hash": 11732005227458121469,
      "translation": "struct platform_driver",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:53:27.428773Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "A minimal platform driver",
      "source_hash": 3231802414293367443,
      "context_hash": 1750770550958675383,
      "translation": "최소한의 플랫폼 드라이버",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "driver": "드라이버"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:53:27.428773Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "devm_: automatic resource management",
      "source_hash": 10142895591680800681,
      "context_hash": 354741163919047709,
      "translation": "devm_: 자동 리소스 관리",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:53:27.428773Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "`devm_` (device-managed) functions bind resource lifetime to a `struct device`.",
      "source_hash": 15692182471486455266,
      "context_hash": 3640581129870414137,
      "translation": "`devm_`(디바이스 관리, device-managed) 함수는 리소스의 수명을 `struct device`에 묶습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "device": "디바이스"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:26:01.266202Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "When the device is unbound (removed), all `devm_` resources are freed in reverse registration order.",
      "source_hash": 16287945177042765762,
      "context_hash": 1891134202858573507,
      "translation": "디바이스가 언바인드(제거)되면 모든 `devm_` 리소스가 등록의 역순으로 해제됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "device": "디바이스"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:53:27.428774Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "Why devm_ matters",
      "source_hash": 9960066973724687183,
      "context_hash": 8798866518047850658,
      "translation": "devm_이 중요한 이유",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:53:27.428774Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Device tree binding",
      "source_hash": 5628577420075021298,
      "context_hash": 9647169657258334157,
      "translation": "디바이스 트리 바인딩",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "device": "디바이스"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:53:27.428774Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "The device tree describes hardware topology.",
      "source_hash": 15271472756090109592,
      "context_hash": 13390055722039943630,
      "translation": "디바이스 트리는 하드웨어 토폴로지를 기술합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "device": "디바이스",
        "hardware": "하드웨어"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:53:27.428774Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "Each node with a `compatible` property can be matched by a driver:",
      "source_hash": 8199372029543252865,
      "context_hash": 15975758798618349444,
      "translation": "`compatible` 속성을 가진 각 노드는 드라이버와 매칭될 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "driver": "드라이버",
        "node": "노드"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:53:27.428774Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "The platform bus automatically creates a `platform_device` from this node when the kernel boots.",
      "source_hash": 5902863116125745679,
      "context_hash": 5904749675215947643,
      "translation": "플랫폼 버스는 커널이 부팅될 때 이 노드로부터 `platform_device`를 자동으로 생성합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "kernel": "커널",
        "node": "노드"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:53:27.428774Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:3/seg:1",
      "source": "The driver's `of_match_table` is compared against `compatible`.",
      "source_hash": 18409258585378812453,
      "context_hash": 3141033169240258338,
      "translation": "드라이버의 `of_match_table`이 `compatible`과 비교됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "driver": "드라이버"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:53:27.428774Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "Reading device tree properties",
      "source_hash": 13042879729489666293,
      "context_hash": 11512885608711750931,
      "translation": "디바이스 트리 속성 읽기",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "device": "디바이스"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:53:27.428774Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Deferring probe",
      "source_hash": 15813728617543429820,
      "context_hash": 10286546739110727588,
      "translation": "probe 지연",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:53:27.428774Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "If a resource isn't ready yet (e.g., a clock driver hasn't probed yet):",
      "source_hash": 12173932566487813258,
      "context_hash": 1009111334000473848,
      "translation": "리소스가 아직 준비되지 않은 경우(예: 클럭 드라이버가 아직 probe되지 않은 경우):",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "driver": "드라이버"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:53:27.428774Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "`-EPROBE_DEFER` tells the probe infrastructure to retry this driver once any other driver finishes probing.",
      "source_hash": 17973035321406887696,
      "context_hash": 15948436873029787660,
      "translation": "`-EPROBE_DEFER`는 다른 드라이버가 probe를 마칠 때마다 이 드라이버를 다시 시도하도록 probe 인프라에 알립니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "driver": "드라이버"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:53:27.428774Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:0/seg:0",
